    "name": "Tafraoute Almond Blossom Festival",
    "id": "tafraoute-almond-blossom-festival",
    "description": "Celebration of the almond bloom in Tafraoute, the heart of Morocco's almond country in the Anti-Atlas. Amazigh music and dance, local crafts and almond specialties mark the short window when the valleys turn white and pink.",
